  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "2400801",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "240080101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "240080101": {
            "id": "240080101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roialte",
            "text": "If not for those Blubberbeasts, I should have been able to hook the larger fish... *sigh*",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080104"
            ]
          },
          "240080104": {
            "id": "240080104",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roialte",
            "text": "Oh, Traveler! Pleased to see you here, most pleased! Are you here to fish, too?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080105"
            ]
          },
          "240080105": {
            "id": "240080105",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roialte",
            "text": "Hmm... It seems you're just passing through. It's alright. This fishing point has got fish for two and then some, so if you don't mind, come, sit and fish with me.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080106"
            ]
          },
          "240080106": {
            "id": "240080106",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Tell me about Iaune...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080107"
            ]
          },
          "240080107": {
            "id": "240080107",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roialte",
            "text": "Iaune? He should be in the Maison Gestion writing that report of his. Don't worry, he'll be fine.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080108"
            ]
          },
          "240080108": {
            "id": "240080108",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roialte",
            "text": "I wasn't lying before, either. This is indeed a good opportunity for him. Not everyone has the chance to submit written documents to the Chief Justice on their own.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080109"
            ]
          },
          "240080109": {
            "id": "240080109",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wait, he's really submitting reports to *the* Chief Justice?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080110"
            ]
          },
          "240080110": {
            "id": "240080110",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "It was just a matter of one keycap. How did it get this serious...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080111"
            ]
          },
          "240080111": {
            "id": "240080111",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roialte",
            "text": "Yes, it was indeed only one keycap, but that was not the end of the matter... It is a \"financial issue,\" if one were to use the high-flown term for it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080112"
            ]
          },
          "240080112": {
            "id": "240080112",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Is that... very serious?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080113"
            ]
          },
          "240080113": {
            "id": "240080113",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But a keycap doesn't even cost that much. Iaune could've just gotten one with his own Mora...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080114"
            ]
          },
          "240080114": {
            "id": "240080114",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roialte",
            "text": "This problem is very serious. From your perspective, a single keycap costs very little, and would mean little if submitted as expenses or paid for yourself.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080115"
            ]
          },
          "240080115": {
            "id": "240080115",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roialte",
            "text": "But if you look at it from our perspective, this represents an \"exception\" to the rules the Maison Gestion operates by.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080116"
            ]
          },
          "240080116": {
            "id": "240080116",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roialte",
            "text": "Yes, you could say that a single keycap matters very little, but if someone were to try to profit off this \"exception,\" then, we would be in trouble.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080117"
            ]
          },
          "240080117": {
            "id": "240080117",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roialte",
            "text": "As to \"what sort of trouble might occur\"... I'll have to tell you later. In any case, there is something I need your help with at the moment."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2400802",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Roialte",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2400803",
      "subQuestName": "Defeat all the Blubberbeasts",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "240080301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "240080301": {
            "id": "240080301",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roialte",
            "text": "This bait's running out so quickly. What's going on...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080302"
            ]
          },
          "240080302": {
            "id": "240080302",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "You've come a long way for some fish.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080303"
            ]
          },
          "240080303": {
            "id": "240080303",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roialte",
            "text": "Ah, so we meet here, I see. What a coincidence!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080304"
            ]
          },
          "240080304": {
            "id": "240080304",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roialte",
            "text": "Anyway, that's just how fishing is, we've gotta follow the fish. Carrying your gear and tramping about with your fishing buddies is quite the unique pleasure as well, you know?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080305"
            ]
          },
          "240080305": {
            "id": "240080305",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But you've gone such a long distance... What if your fishing gear breaks?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080306"
            ]
          },
          "240080306": {
            "id": "240080306",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roialte",
            "text": "You're right, and that's something I'm concerned about at the moment.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080307"
            ]
          },
          "240080307": {
            "id": "240080307",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "So your gear did break!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080308"
            ]
          },
          "240080308": {
            "id": "240080308",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roialte",
            "text": "Oh, it happens. I've already fixed it, anyway. The only problem is that I've been unable to find suitable bait.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080309"
            ]
          },
          "240080309": {
            "id": "240080309",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Uh, couldn't you just dig up a few worms and use them?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080310"
            ]
          },
          "240080310": {
            "id": "240080310",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roialte",
            "text": "No, that wouldn't do. Those fish are a picky lot. They're not going to go for worms previously held in human hands.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080311"
            ]
          },
          "240080311": {
            "id": "240080311",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roialte",
            "text": "But we can't make any other sort of bait here...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080312"
            ]
          },
          "240080312": {
            "id": "240080312",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roialte",
            "text": "Traveler, could I trouble you to go into the city and get me some bait?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080315"
            ]
          },
          "240080315": {
            "id": "240080315",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roialte",
            "text": "Hahaha, don't worry, I'll pay you, as is the rule for adventurers.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080316"
            ]
          },
          "240080316": {
            "id": "240080316",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roialte",
            "text": "I paid Boucicaut a bit of a sum beforehand. Just grab a box of bait from him on my behalf, and that'll do."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2400804",
      "subQuestName": "Defeat all the Hydro Slimes",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "240080401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "240080401": {
            "id": "240080401",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Boucicaut",
            "text": "Hello. What may I do for you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080402"
            ]
          },
          "240080402": {
            "id": "240080402",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Roialte would like some bait...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080403"
            ]
          },
          "240080403": {
            "id": "240080403",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Boucicaut",
            "text": "Seriously? Fishing in the wilderness again, is he? Archons, and I keep telling him that it isn't safe...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080404"
            ]
          },
          "240080404": {
            "id": "240080404",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Boucicaut",
            "text": "If anything were to happen, no one would even be there to hear him scream. But he just won't listen to me...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080405"
            ]
          },
          "240080405": {
            "id": "240080405",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Boucicaut",
            "text": "He'll probably only listen after something happens, I fear.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080406"
            ]
          },
          "240080406": {
            "id": "240080406",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Boucicaut",
            "text": "Anyway, here's the bait. Take it to Roialte — and remind him to stay safe while you're at it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080407"
            ]
          },
          "240080407": {
            "id": "240080407",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Boucicaut",
            "text": "Seriously, would it really hurt him to call a few people to join him for a fishing session?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2400805",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Boucicaut",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2400806",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Roialte",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "240080501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "240080501": {
            "id": "240080501",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roialte",
            "text": "Wonderful! Those silly Blubberbeasts have been chased off — and with that, my peace of mind is restored! Thank you so much, Traveler.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080504"
            ]
          },
          "240080504": {
            "id": "240080504",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roialte",
            "text": "Alright, alright. Now, where was I previously... Give me a moment to recall the story...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080505"
            ]
          },
          "240080505": {
            "id": "240080505",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "You were talking about \"exceptions.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080506"
            ]
          },
          "240080506": {
            "id": "240080506",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roialte",
            "text": "Ah, yes, that was it. I was talking about making a profit off exceptional circumstances...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080507"
            ]
          },
          "240080507": {
            "id": "240080507",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roialte",
            "text": "For example, someone might be able to scrub the various resources they have on hand, and then report them as expenses... or try to expand the scope of this particular \"exception\"... These are all things that can happen.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080508"
            ]
          },
          "240080508": {
            "id": "240080508",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "And have such things happened?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080509"
            ]
          },
          "240080509": {
            "id": "240080509",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roialte",
            "text": "Before Iaune was with us, we had another clever fellow. He was very able, very clever, sharp, and full of energy.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080510"
            ]
          },
          "240080510": {
            "id": "240080510",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roialte",
            "text": "...Unfortunately, he was not honest.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080511"
            ]
          },
          "240080511": {
            "id": "240080511",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roialte",
            "text": "Eventually, he was booted from the office, and I haven't seen him since... nor do I wish to, really.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080512"
            ]
          },
          "240080512": {
            "id": "240080512",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Did he do something terrible, then?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080513"
            ]
          },
          "240080513": {
            "id": "240080513",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roialte",
            "text": "He certainly did not think that about his doings — and that is precisely the kind of mindset that gives birth to criminality.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080514"
            ]
          },
          "240080514": {
            "id": "240080514",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roialte",
            "text": "That's why I have high expectations for Iaune. He's not the sharpest tool in the shed, but he's honest and diligent.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080515"
            ]
          },
          "240080515": {
            "id": "240080515",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That doesn't sound like praise...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080516"
            ]
          },
          "240080516": {
            "id": "240080516",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roialte",
            "text": "But honesty is the greatest virtue. A dishonest but intelligent person may achieve great fame in a short period of time...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080520"
            ]
          },
          "240080520": {
            "id": "240080520",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roialte",
            "text": "But it is often those stupid yet honest people who will accomplish truly great things.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080517"
            ]
          },
          "240080517": {
            "id": "240080517",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roialte",
            "text": "Alright, I'm going to continue fishing now. Please, take this as your payment. Hahaha, don't look so surprised. Did you really think I was just going to pay you with a story?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080518"
            ]
          },
          "240080518": {
            "id": "240080518",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roialte",
            "text": "All those who labor must be compensated — that's always been my motto.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080519"
            ]
          },
          "240080519": {
            "id": "240080519",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roialte",
            "text": "Thank you once again. I'm sure I'll score a great catch this time."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
