    {
      "subId": "2400808",
      "subQuestName": "Defeat all the Blubberbeasts",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "240080801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "240080801": {
            "id": "240080801",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roialte",
            "text": "*sigh* These silly Blubberbeasts just won't leave, will they...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080802"
            ]
          },
          "240080802": {
            "id": "240080802",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Fishing again?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080803"
            ]
          },
          "240080803": {
            "id": "240080803",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roialte",
            "text": "Well, what does it look like I'm doing? I just chased off a few of those unreasonable journalists, so I'm just taking a little fishing break.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080804"
            ]
          },
          "240080804": {
            "id": "240080804",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roialte",
            "text": "But these Blubberbeasts just won't leave, and I daren't approach them... *sigh*",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080805"
            ]
          },
          "240080805": {
            "id": "240080805",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roialte",
            "text": "Honestly! Did they learn their trade from those journalists? And did they master those dastardly arts of opportunistic deception?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080806"
            ]
          },
          "240080806": {
            "id": "240080806",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "You really do hate journalists, huh.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080807"
            ]
          },
          "240080807": {
            "id": "240080807",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roialte",
            "text": "Of course. Some of them raise a hue and cry about reporting the truth, but truth, as they see it, is for them to define.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080808"
            ]
          },
          "240080808": {
            "id": "240080808",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roialte",
            "text": "They claim to be doing this for the masses, but they don't even know about this...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080809"
            ]
          },
          "240080809": {
            "id": "240080809",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roialte",
            "text": "Hmm, I should stay silent. You never know if there might be a journalist in a divesuit eavesdropping on us from under water.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080810"
            ]
          },
          "240080810": {
            "id": "240080810",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roialte",
            "text": "Traveler, could I trouble you to get rid of those Blubberbeasts? Just thinking about journalists is making my head spin... I need to take my medicine and rest a while more, I think.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080813"
            ]
          },
          "240080813": {
            "id": "240080813",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roialte",
            "text": "Thank you. I'm afraid I'll have to find another good place to fish..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2400809",
      "subQuestName": "Defeat all the Hydro Slimes",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "240080901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "240080901": {
            "id": "240080901",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roialte",
            "text": "Have you gotten rid of those silly Blubberbeasts? Wonderful! You truly are my savior!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080902"
            ]
          },
          "240080902": {
            "id": "240080902",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Have you been well lately?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080903"
            ]
          },
          "240080903": {
            "id": "240080903",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roialte",
            "text": "Not bad, not bad, I suppose. Iaune has gone back to his normal self at last, and Semaine's as reliable as ever.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080904"
            ]
          },
          "240080904": {
            "id": "240080904",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roialte",
            "text": "Every day is as peaceful as the last. It's a good life... And it would be better if those journalists would just stop calling at our door.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080905"
            ]
          },
          "240080905": {
            "id": "240080905",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roialte",
            "text": "Please take this as your payment. If not for you, my fishing plans would have been a bust.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "240080906"
            ]
          },
          "240080906": {
            "id": "240080906",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Roialte",
            "text": "I need to pick another fishing spot. Where should I go..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
